questions.description:
The app imports only `selectCart` from this file. `createStore` comes from a library whose code the bundler cannot prove free of side effects.

```js
// store.js
import { createStore } from 'tiny-store';

export const store = createStore(rootReducer);

export function selectCart(state) {
  return state.cart;
}
```

The project builds with webpack and `css-loader`. Components load their styles like this:

```js
import './Button.css';

export function Button(props) {
  // …
}
```

```js
if (process.env.NODE_ENV !== 'production') {
  warnDev('Each child in a list needs a unique key');
}
```

```js
export async function loadMessages(lang) {
  const { default: messages } = await import(`./locales/${lang}.js`);
  return messages;
}
```
